
  sfh — Static File Host

  📁 dir    /workspace/oracle/data
  🌐 port   :4041
  🔑 auth   admin:***

  Browse → http://localhost:4041/
  Manage → http://localhost:4041/update  (needs auth)

  curl API (read — public):
    curl http://HOST:4041/api/ls
    curl http://HOST:4041/api/ls?path=/subdir
    curl http://HOST:4041/api/cat?path=/file.txt
    curl http://HOST:4041/api/download?path=/file.txt -o file.txt

  curl API (write — requires -u admin:PASS):
    curl -u admin:PASS -X POST 'http://HOST:4041/api/mkdir?path=/dir'
    curl -u admin:PASS -T file.txt 'http://HOST:4041/api/upload?path=/&name=file.txt'
    curl -u admin:PASS -F 'files=@photo.png' 'http://HOST:4041/api/upload?path=/'
    curl -u admin:PASS -X DELETE 'http://HOST:4041/api/delete?path=/file.txt'
    curl -u admin:PASS -X POST 'http://HOST:4041/api/move?from=/a.txt&to=/b.txt'

